      "sourceEnText": "The maps show the meanders of the river.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_06d2470.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "alice",
      "actorId": "ADULT_F",
      "durationMs": 2560,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T18:46:10Z",
      "textHash": "2ca78ccff06621060b65d23c825622ac07e43ff272cb81995f8167434e45843c"
    },
    {
      "key": "072a345",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_french_woman",
      "sourceText": "Guten Morgen!",
      "sourceEnText": "Good morning!",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_072a345.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "alice",
      "actorId": "ADULT_F",
      "durationMs": 1176,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T18:45:47Z",
      "textHash": "38f47af50d0662135eeb9f19bb4a18c5963ad636e0fa9a38e9b6967ec98f9a5e"
    },
    {
      "key": "074efa5",
      "nodeTitle": "facts_river",
      "sourceText": "Die Seine mündet in den Ärmelkanal.",
      "sourceEnText": "The Seine flows into the English Channel.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_074efa5.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "alice",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2377,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T18:45:44Z",
      "textHash": "4d58252ae9e85eeefe8909353744bedbaa52b0b7c7154c9f9f417475a5bc7984"
    },
    {
      "key": "076ee7f",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_bridge_cars",
      "sourceText": "Man kann die Straße überall überqueren.",
      "sourceEnText": "You can cross the road anywhere.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_076ee7f.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "alice",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2534,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T18:44:54Z",
      "textHash": "82c6304a79af67d8e60201b8c97fb000f99a89b0a1b2b12857b24f692a44b19f"
    },
    {
      "key": "07cac48",
      "nodeTitle": "protagonist",
      "sourceText": "Du hast alle Fotos aus meinem Reiseführer gefunden!",
      "sourceEnText": "You found all the photos from my guide!",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_07cac48.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "alice",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 3370,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T18:42:45Z",
      "textHash": "52a5f14aadbd6f058c9acd1bc02582f92be3732c44005f2d8993da994d24513c"
    },
    {
      "key": "07f732f",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_bridge_people",
      "sourceText": "eine Brücke für Autos",
      "sourceEnText": "a bridge for cars",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_07f732f.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "ADULT_M",
      "durationMs": 1515,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T18:45:22Z",
      "textHash": "c5d2b6f54bff746514788db1a7883034e8fcb0ebdb5f29edf688dff222313fdd"
    },
    {
      "key": "0816b6b",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_bridge_expert",
      "sourceText": "Eine Eisenbahnbrücke muss stabil sein.",
      "sourceEnText": "A train bridge must be strong.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0816b6b.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "ADULT_M",
      "durationMs": 2194,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T18:46:01Z",
      "textHash": "0b898db3a3dc69a8a5e315aed355f8df4f65e813aa3456a3002aa1a91b483a1f"
    },
    {
      "key": "084c7e4",
      "nodeTitle": "protagonist",
      "sourceText": "Spazieren Sie am Seineufer entlang und finden Sie die Fotos!",
      "sourceEnText": "Take a walk along the banks of the Seine and find the photos!",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_084c7e4.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "alice",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 3788,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T18:42:53Z",
      "textHash": "96b7b66e268c37b6bd8e861f5c861468351b450ab0cc1e8706f92e74636818f3"
    },
    {
      "key": "08b0aea",
      "nodeTitle": "protagonist",
      "sourceText": "Ich kann endlich nach Hause! Ich habe noch eine letzte Frage…",
      "sourceEnText": "I can finally go home! I have one last question…",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_08b0aea.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "alice",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 3814,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T18:42:47Z",
      "textHash": "da9b725443240e76295a05fa875e927938dfda451a4c6850c2dd8b53a8550f82"
    },
    {
      "key": "08b1177",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_seine_map",
      "sourceText": "Schau dir diese Karte der Seine an.",
      "sourceEnText": "Look at this map of the Seine.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_08b1177.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "alice",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2377,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T18:45:25Z",
      "textHash": "39731de4c74d25a130cf0ba8ef1cfe4cbb0812855b9c39eb4894cd1c4817ab3a"
    },
    {
      "key": "08b4fad",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_bridge_train",
      "sourceText": "für Autos",
      "sourceEnText": "for cars",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_08b4fad.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "alice",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1097,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T18:45:06Z",
      "textHash": "33d006d3b59faefd9d19a3ef1b4ae5d1ad198fddddb2e79e00e253efe520bcde"
    },
    {
      "key": "08cc02a",
      "nodeTitle": "quest_end",
      "sourceText": "Rund um die Seine wurden bedeutende Denkmäler in Paris errichtet.",
      "sourceEnText": "Important monuments in Paris were built around the Seine.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_08cc02a.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "alice",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 4206,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T18:42:38Z",
      "textHash": "f404e0e79889e2cc37c95fc5b64c3a7b107fa93bb447e75b9bbcd5ec56c37d02"
    },
    {
      "key": "08d8ef0",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_bridge_expert",
      "sourceText": "Autos überqueren den Fluss jeden Tag.",
      "sourceEnText": "Cars cross the river every day.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_08d8ef0.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "ADULT_M",
      "durationMs": 2612,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T18:46:05Z",
      "textHash": "4060f6002042d939d70c647be7a864b9b29c2f88a78df4c9ad803a04fc0ac61c"
    },
    {
      "key": "091e9fc",
      "nodeTitle": "quest_end",
      "sourceText": "Sie haben die Brücken und Boote über die Seine entdeckt. Die Brücken ermöglichen es Ihnen, den Fluss zu überqueren, der durch Paris fließt: die Seine.",
      "sourceEnText": "You discovered the bridges and boats of the Seine. The bridges allow you to cross the river that flows through Paris: the Seine.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_091e9fc.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "alice",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 9665,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T18:42:29Z",
      "textHash": "ad5cd28f6c1f053e464981f8f2f27062ff761be5b2485320b2a9e907a7bede15"
    },
    {
      "key": "09731f9",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_bridge_train",
      "sourceText": "Eine Eisenbahnbrücke ist eine Brücke...",
      "sourceEnText": "A train bridge is a bridge...",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_09731f9.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "alice",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2482,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T18:45:01Z",
      "textHash": "22768e149565c48953b93ea05da30d2bcc3a23a10aff0918468e977ef6f1bb60"
    },
    {
      "key": "099fe86",
      "nodeTitle": "question_seine_map",
      "sourceText": "Das ist nicht die richtige Antwort. Die Loire fließt durch Nantes, in der Nähe des Jules-Verne-Museums.",
      "sourceEnText": "That's not the correct answer. The Loire flows through Nantes, near the Jules Verne Museum.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_099fe86.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "alice",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 6322,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T18:43:22Z",
      "textHash": "3036b2e32b2e73a20420b95f9a6a90ffb9a118d12b33abeb9b580b8c70a1a74e"
    },
    {
      "key": "09c706f",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_bridge_alexandre",
      "sourceText": "Das ist die Alexander-III.-Brücke. Sie ist eine sehr berühmte Brücke.",
      "sourceEnText": "This is the Alexander III Bridge. It's a very famous bridge.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_09c706f.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "alice",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 5303,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T18:44:33Z",
      "textHash": "c6077501d6f69d4806e635ad7fb2df5f78c32ca4cc1d9f8deb861f7aa5f9b7c3"
    },
    {
      "key": "09f3f7a",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_boat",
      "sourceText": "Ein Hund? Hier gibt es viele Hunde...",
      "sourceEnText": "A dog? There are many dogs here...",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_09f3f7a.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "ADULT_M",
      "durationMs": 2377,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T18:45:32Z",
      "textHash": "33342637dd1ee62000015745fefd307bfaeb8c6700c1f141fdeb3c3d8bbd1087"
    },
    {
      "key": "0a0991d",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_bridge_train",
      "sourceText": "Es ist eine Brücke für Züge!",
      "sourceEnText": "It's a bridge for trains!",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0a0991d.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "alice",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1959,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T18:44:58Z",
      "textHash": "ac9744a559714740292432492c7b9260bbcc3b7a9ceaed547ac2e0af2f9d7bf3"
    },
    {
      "key": "0a29742",
      "nodeTitle": "quest_end",
      "sourceText": "Es gibt Hausboote. Menschen leben auf diesen Booten. Sie werden Lastkähne genannt.",
      "sourceEnText": "There are houseboats. People live on these boats. They are called barges.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0a29742.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "alice",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 5642,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T18:42:35Z",
      "textHash": "997648001ceaf795940a5c8e00313728a3ed1c2372ddde9e70339a4c1e98495a"
    },
    {
      "key": "0a2bcd3",
      "nodeTitle": "question_seine_map",
      "sourceText": "Ja, es ist die Seine. Der Fluss, der durch Paris fließt, heißt Seine.",
      "sourceEnText": "Yes, it's the Seine. The river that flows through Paris is called the Seine.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0a2bcd3.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "alice",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 4754,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T18:43:28Z",
      "textHash": "f487c116cbd34d1ea09978584812f175a3b2dc80201eb69a4cb1236dbb27489e"
    },
    {
      "key": "0a627c2",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_boat_house",
      "sourceText": "Dieses Boot ist ein Haus. Es gibt Menschen, die auf diesem Boot leben. Dieses Boot nennt man Hausboot.",
      "sourceEnText": "This boat is a house. There are people who live on this boat. This boat is called a houseboat.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0a627c2.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "alice",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 7027,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T18:44:07Z",
      "textHash": "140fdfe0ca2bb3095c6547af9171085aad579803f87d71c9efff6f91c2e664f3"
    },
    {
      "key": "0a70250",
      "nodeTitle": "protagonist",
      "sourceText": "Danke schön!",
      "sourceEnText": "Thank you!",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0a70250.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "alice",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1123,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T18:42:42Z",
      "textHash": "c285b2d5f831fe55f79595d416d9f3349513f0fd903bb551ffbca87e1c94490f"
    },
    {
      "key": "0a9c8e7",
      "nodeTitle": "protagonist",
      "sourceText": "Geh am Fluss entlang und du findest die Fotos!",
      "sourceEnText": "Walk near the river and you'll find the photos!",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0a9c8e7.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "alice",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 3370,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T18:43:09Z",
      "textHash": "a1ee1d7f29a3a32ca8cf67a4a3ca27230da30089bc0f1928f74efe6264e5fcb3"
    },
    {
      "key": "0aa0f3a",
      "nodeTitle": "protagonist",
      "sourceText": "Hilfe! Helft mir!",
      "sourceEnText": "Help! Help me!",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0aa0f3a.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "alice",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1515,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T18:43:00Z",
      "textHash": "5e61068bf9f19b98ad396ac4c9045d2e8107436ce8407597e178ebc3fbf4c2fb"
    },
    {
      "key": "0b12cb3",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_boat_goods",
      "sourceText": "Ein Güterschiff kann transportieren: Holz, Sand, aber auch Gegenstände: Autos, Möbel...",
      "sourceEnText": "Boxes and things",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0b12cb3.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "alice",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 5721,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T18:43:39Z",
      "textHash": "06a5eae215357188134bb85b88784603482898deb4fbcfd38a5bd5c8a0df1a70"
    },
    {
      "key": "0b37e92",
      "nodeTitle": "post_quest_activity",
      "sourceText": "Zeichne eine Brücke in dein Notizbuch!",
      "sourceEnText": "Draw a bridge in your notebook!",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0b37e92.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "alice",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2429,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T18:42:40Z",
      "textHash": "ff9c268d197c75fa5a23e09d283c269e47dec4fcc37ff8bf5ecce49ef52b3f63"
    },
    {
      "key": "0ba2f29",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_bridge_expert",
      "sourceText": "Manche Brücken sind nur für Fußgänger bestimmt.",
      "sourceEnText": "Some bridges are intended for pedestrians only.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0ba2f29.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "ADULT_M",
      "durationMs": 2482,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T18:46:03Z",
      "textHash": "460f18d4c6862a2aa51c112e07161b6ed25397944fb328207dbf49be8cee3646"
    },
    {
      "key": "0bbd3ce",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_boat_goods",
      "sourceText": "Touristen mit Kameras",
      "sourceEnText": "Tourists with cameras",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0bbd3ce.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "alice",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1541,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T18:43:44Z",
      "textHash": "d8ccf969426d8058be377b5d024262492b74cfb5b490815926d89cf2d2bb70d7"
    },
    {
      "key": "0bfcb05",
      "nodeTitle": "protagonist",
      "sourceText": "Falls Sie sie nicht finden können, können Sie sie mithilfe der Karte von Paris lokalisieren!",
      "sourceEnText": "If you can't find them, you can use the map of Paris to locate them!",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0bfcb05.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "alice",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 5407,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T18:42:56Z",
      "textHash": "84cac473d0dc8910d533d01f6d5970997aa2aa89deabe4ee598edbbdb9b729ca"
    },
    {
      "key": "0c408c3",
      "nodeTitle": "quest_end",
      "sourceText": "Großartig, du hast diese Quest abgeschlossen!",
      "sourceEnText": "Great, you've completed this quest!",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0c408c3.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "alice",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 3448,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T18:42:26Z",
      "textHash": "aeaa887b742aa10f467e3bde173f621ed2cef981dcbd730437a48edf9a7b7f00"
    },
    {
      "key": "0c86d26",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_boat_house",
      "sourceText": "Es ist möglich, dort zu leben.",
      "sourceEnText": "It's possible to live there.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0c86d26.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "alice",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1959,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T18:44:12Z",
      "textHash": "3edc1e8d84d944b3698cd57b7c46739a81d3a49a7336b83c767c38e04ed44b9d"
    },
    {
      "key": "0c8cdae",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_bridge_cars",
      "sourceText": "Sie müssen auf dem Gehweg gehen und den Fußgängerüberweg benutzen.",
      "sourceEnText": "Use the sidewalk and cross at the crossing",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0c8cdae.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "alice",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 4101,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T18:44:51Z",
      "textHash": "76acb67da4a68d1d0f555ad9ecc64603832e4935a42fbd7765a9ff3ec86f864d"
    },
    {
      "key": "0c8e7b6",
      "nodeTitle": "protagonist",
      "sourceText": "Die Seiten meines Buches und die Fotos fielen in die Nähe der Seine!",
      "sourceEnText": "The pages of my book and the photos fell near the Seine!",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0c8e7b6.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "alice",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 4937,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T18:43:06Z",
      "textHash": "7f2e9ac7689fe5809b60d15eb54b270af9c66df247a5779bc669992ed25231cf"
    },
    {
      "key": "0cf371b",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_bridge_cars",
      "sourceText": "Du musst auf der Straße gehen",
      "sourceEnText": "You have to walk on the road",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0cf371b.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "alice",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1776,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T18:44:56Z",
      "textHash": "7f856d6e3cae30b263bf738185b4792e4252c1168ad4a182ae6578e690cc76ec"
    },
    {
      "key": "0d1724c",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_river_friend",
      "sourceText": "Der Fluss mündet ins Meer.",
      "sourceEnText": "The river flows into the sea.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0d1724c.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "alice",
      "actorId": "ADULT_F",
      "durationMs": 1698,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T18:46:13Z",
      "textHash": "831cbb060355316c4a6ca3e40fa0b46a2fbea10b267ae76185d69522f69e5ad4"
    },
    {
      "key": "0d79d7d",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_bridge_cars",
      "sourceText": "Das ist eine Brücke für Autos!",
      "sourceEnText": "It's a bridge for cars!",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0d79d7d.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "alice",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2064,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T18:44:46Z",
      "textHash": "2d91909e43bcd7fa23129b059d6098876876747fdbb0c73d39cc5020c5e72d46"
    },
    {
      "key": "0d94ea8",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_french_man",
      "sourceText": "Paris ist die schönste Stadt der Welt!",
      "sourceEnText": "Paris is the most beautiful city in the world!",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0d94ea8.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "ADULT_M",
      "durationMs": 2194,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T18:45:57Z",
      "textHash": "35e07f7f79ad5388c607f541526f650cfa4db4018b2347e6e7b0d36903d7e62b"
    },
    {
      "key": "0d9bc29",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_bridge_alexandre",
      "sourceText": "Es ist eine Brücke für Autos.",
      "sourceEnText": "It's a bridge for cars.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0d9bc29.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "alice",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2011,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T18:44:43Z",
      "textHash": "f2894072858e2332ae70125b194c63f45f7f1fbe1694f8b2f8c1645984887a10"
    },
    {
      "key": "0e48593",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_bridge_people",
      "sourceText": "Steg",
      "sourceEnText": "Footbridge",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0e48593.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "ADULT_M",
      "durationMs": 705,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T18:45:19Z",
      "textHash": "f6de241b529cfc98f68b5d0f526351b836c5ce15703b00d3792ed9042483cfcd"
    },
    {
      "key": "0ec822e",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_river_friend",
      "sourceText": "Auf der Seine können Boote in Paris verkehren.",
      "sourceEnText": "The Seine allows boats to circulate in Paris.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0ec822e.mp3",
